    "suggested_action": "replace_ja_expression",
    "reason": "While 参謀 (sanbou) can be glossed as 'adviser' (as per JMdict Sense 1), its primary and most common connotation is military or strategic (e.g., staff officer, strategist, chief of staff), as indicated by JMdict Sense 0. For a general 'adviser' in a daily life context, this term is too narrow and carries a specific nuance that might mislead learners. More general and natural terms are available.",
