      "reading": "じょげんしゃ",
      "reason": "助言者 (jogensha) is a more general and natural term for 'adviser' or 'counselor' in a broad range of contexts, without the specific military or strategic connotation of 参謀. アドバイザー (adobaizaa) is also a very common and natural loanword for 'adviser'."
